      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277490/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dissolve ham stock and coffee granules in water in a large mixing bowl to create a stock.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GePCAeNveBklymNLaKhaLy7fKRg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277490-red-eye-gravy-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-7322507f9400407bb737b7451e7693f7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277490/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a medium saucepan over medium-high heat; add flour. Cook butter and flour, stirring constantly, until brown, to create a roux, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f3P8ZUDeq1w54vzktmGoOFaiHz4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277490-red-eye-gravy-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-608ab155a17e44cd9f51875a3bdbf574.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277490/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add stock mixture, ½ cup at a time to the roux, stirring constantly, until it has the consistency of gravy, 5 to 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UrxmomYFwrDLSNfgjnAk0q6U3DY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277490-red-eye-gravy-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-7d34d520b40f4b8ca1f3fd3121150958.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277490/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in black pepper. Remove from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
